Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.80,0:00:06.57,Flashback,Icilla,0,0,0,,I'm sorry... I... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.57,0:00:11.41,Flashback,Icilla,0,0,0,,I put the secret elixir of the sea \Nin Prince Aquasteed's tea!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.93,0:00:13.78,Flashback,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Don't cry, Icilla.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.63,0:00:20.00,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Stop! Look at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.00,0:00:21.68,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Prince Aqua!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.72,0:00:40.44,Default,Title,0,0,0,,{\an2\c&HFC8A3D&\shad0\fnTimes New Roman\fs28\3c&HFDFBFA&\b1\fad(604,100)\t(20,4733,\fs23)\move(336,79,336,93,20,4733)\c&HB36BF7&\t(3108,3108,\c&H5280F6&)\t(3191,3191,\c&HACF29E&)\t(3399,3399,\c&H19D3F7&)\t(3775,3775,\c&HFC8A3D&)}The Villainess {\c&H343E6B&\t(3108,3108,\c&H754D00&)\t(3191,3191,\c&H6286B0&)\t(3399,3399,\c&H334A70&)\t(3775,3775,\c&H343E6B&)}Is {\c&HB36BF7&\t(3108,3108,\c&HEF65A0&)\t(3191,3191,\c&H7B72F5&)\t(3399,3399,\c&HEFF400&)\t(3775,3775,\c&HB36BF7&)}Adored \N{\c&H343E6B&\t(3108,3108,\c&H754D00&)\t(3191,3191,\c&H6286B0&)\t(3399,3399,\c&H334A70&)\t(3775,3775,\c&H343E6B&)}by the Prince of the Neighbor Kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.76,0:01:58.01,Default,Title,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(560,1)\fnTimesNewRoman\shad0\pos(320,123)\c&H343E6B&\3c&HFCFCFC&\fs25}My {\b1\c&HB36BF7&}Beautiful {\c&HFC8A3D&}Lady{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.72,0:02:11.90,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Prince Aqua?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.01,0:02:14.45,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,Prince Aquasteed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.16,0:02:20.65,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,Everything is ready. \NWe must hurry to the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.23,0:02:36.97,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,I can't believe I spoke \Nto Tiara in that voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.18,0:02:44.14,Flashback,Aquasteed FB,0,0,0,,Oh. Tiara, you can wait here \Nat the castle if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.16,0:02:49.52,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I'm the worst man alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.52,0:02:52.14,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,You can say that again!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.14,0:02:55.99,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,So how is that love potion \Nactually affecting you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.99,0:02:58.45,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,It's calmed down compared to before,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.45,0:03:01.37,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,but I'm still in trouble \Nif I see Lady Icilla.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.78,0:03:03.50,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,My heart is wavering.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.50,0:03:05.96,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,But I love Tiara so much...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.76,0:03:10.39,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,I want to say the name of the one I love,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.39,0:03:12.51,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,but I feel like another name \Nwill slip out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.52,0:03:55.54,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,Just what is love, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.40,0:04:32.63,Default,Pearl,0,0,0,,I'm the only one who's all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.62,0:05:00.57,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,Wow. How long has it been \Nsince it was this bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.57,0:05:03.12,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,About 700 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.12,0:05:04.99,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,What are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.99,0:05:08.08,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,You're basically the entire \Ncause of it this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.89,0:05:12.50,Flashback,Pearl FB,0,0,0,,I dislike the woman called Tiararose.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.50,0:05:14.38,Flashback,Pearl FB,0,0,0,,She has some nerve leading Claire on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.90,0:05:20.13,Flashback,Icilla FB,0,0,0,,King Pearl said that \NLady Tiararose is leading you on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.78,0:05:23.61,Italics,Claire INT,0,0,0,,If Pearl really did say that,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.61,0:05:26.74,Italics,Claire INT,0,0,0,,maybe I can hold \Non to the tiniest shred of hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.13,0:05:31.76,Italics,Claire INT,0,0,0,,Though I can't just come out \Nand ask, "You were jealous?"
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.63,0:05:34.09,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Hey, Keith.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.09,0:05:36.74,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,I just had a great idea. \NWould you help me with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.74,0:05:37.89,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.89,0:05:42.36,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,This is your problem. \NWhy do I have to clean up after you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.02,0:05:47.87,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,Fine. Just this once.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.87,0:05:50.83,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,I had a feeling you'd say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.83,0:05:54.44,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,Oh, really? So what do you want me to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.40,0:06:07.35,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,We're moving too quickly! \NLet's rest for a bit!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.35,0:06:09.85,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I'm fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.02,0:06:16.46,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,Prince Aquasteed!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.86,0:06:22.01,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,Is this an effect of the drug?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.87,0:06:25.43,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,I know in my head \Nthat it's inconceivable,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.43,0:06:28.10,Italics,Aquasteed INT,0,0,0,,but my body thirsts for Lady Icilla.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.42,0:06:33.31,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,Let's return to the castle for now. \NIn that condition, you can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.31,0:06:34.51,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.82,0:06:37.87,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I have to get to the ocean, \Nwhatever it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.71,0:06:40.60,Default,Elliot,0,0,0,,Prince Aquasteed...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.35,0:06:47.72,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Prince Aqua!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.85,0:06:52.14,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Tiara?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.76,0:06:54.89,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Yes, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.89,0:06:56.52,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.18,0:07:00.61,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.57,0:07:04.68,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,No. It's because of the love potion.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.68,0:07:06.53,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,It's not his fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.77,0:07:09.13,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Tiara...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.12,0:07:12.33,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,Your Highness!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.28,0:07:16.75,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,Your Highness...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.06,0:07:19.75,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Icilla.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.37,0:07:22.75,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Please don't, Prince Aqua!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.29,0:07:35.23,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Please, Prince Aqua...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.40,0:07:40.23,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Would you indulge my \Nselfish whims once more?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.90,0:07:43.28,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.46,0:07:49.82,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.98,0:08:05.30,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I love Prince Aqua more than \Nanyone in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.32,0:08:08.55,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Tiara?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.48,0:08:12.30,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,How could I do something so ridiculous?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.73,0:08:20.52,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.61,0:08:24.06,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Prince Aqua?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.90,0:08:29.43,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,No... Prince Aqua!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.29,0:08:35.35,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Tiara!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.92,0:08:40.39,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,The sweet voice he always uses...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.26,0:08:46.69,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I can't believe I let a drug overtake me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.69,0:08:48.92,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I'll never forgive myself \Nfor being so spineless.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.51,0:08:55.43,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,You aren't spineless at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.22,0:08:57.48,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.72,0:09:11.49,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,It's pitch-black.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.49,0:09:13.53,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I didn't realize it was this bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.20,0:09:18.89,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Aquasteed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.89,0:09:20.04,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,Tiara.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.44,0:09:22.03,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,You're finally here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.03,0:09:26.37,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Tiararose, I'm sorry Pearl's \Ncaused so much trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.72,0:09:29.52,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I also failed to be attentive enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.88,0:09:33.14,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,King Pearl isn't the only one to blame.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.18,0:09:38.40,Flashback,Pearl FB,0,0,0,,Soon you will feel \Nthe same pain that I feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.73,0:09:41.99,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,King Pearl is hurting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.99,0:09:44.82,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Even if it's a misunderstanding, \Nit's my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.47,0:09:47.90,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,You look like you're in pain. \NWhat happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.90,0:09:49.77,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,You're even wounded!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.14,0:09:51.40,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,That...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.75,0:09:54.22,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,is all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.56,0:09:59.41,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,I forced His Highness to drink \Nthe secret elixir of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.41,0:10:02.58,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Secret elixir? You don't mean Pearl's...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.58,0:10:04.19,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,That little...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.59,0:10:05.92,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,She's so hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.61,0:10:09.48,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,The drug's effects shouldn't last long,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.48,0:10:11.87,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,and Pearl should have the antidote.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.30,0:10:14.56,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,Then I'll go see her right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.56,0:10:16.07,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,You can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.07,0:10:18.73,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,This ocean is dangerous, even to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.73,0:10:21.77,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,If a human like you goes in, \Nyou'll never last.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.17,0:10:24.94,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,I am prepared for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.32,0:10:28.87,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Lady Icilla, you mustn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.87,0:10:30.44,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.80,0:10:32.48,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,You don't need to worry about me,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.48,0:10:35.95,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,but we can't leave \Nthe ocean in this state.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.56,0:10:38.01,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I realize that this is a problem
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.01,0:10:42.88,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,that the humans and sea fairies \Nshould resolve together,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.29,0:10:46.96,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,but since we don't know how \Nto return the ocean to normal,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.96,0:10:49.57,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,you're the only ones we can depend on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.57,0:10:52.92,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Would you please lend us your aid?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.80,0:10:55.01,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I beg you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.93,0:11:00.59,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I'm begging you, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.59,0:11:03.85,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I want our beautiful ocean to come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.59,0:11:10.41,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,Tiara, do you know \Nwhy there are three fairy kings?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.19,0:11:12.32,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,No, I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.85,0:11:16.66,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,So that if one of us \Nloses their way, suffers,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.66,0:11:20.12,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,and warps nature, \Nthe rest of us can right it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.12,0:11:25.83,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,To be precise, humans blessed \Nby the other two fairies must fix it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.41,0:11:28.29,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Is that really true?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.88,0:11:32.31,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,You, Aquasteed, \Nhave received my blessing,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.31,0:11:34.74,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,and Tiararose has received Keith's.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.74,0:11:38.29,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,If the two of you use your magic, \Nyou can restore the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.72,0:11:40.30,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.73,0:11:41.80,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.80,0:11:45.06,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I-I can help heal this vast ocean?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.06,0:11:46.29,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.10,0:11:49.57,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,But I don't have enough magic power!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.57,0:11:53.07,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Prince Aqua does, \Nbut my magic is not enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.76,0:11:55.65,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,You don't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.91,0:12:05.04,Default,Title,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&HFC8A3D&\shad0\fnTimes New Roman\fs24\3c&HFDFBFA&\b1\fad(516,1)\pos(328,51)}The Villainess {\c&H343E6B&}Is {\c&HB36BF7&}Adored \N{\c&H343E6B&)}by the Prince of the Neighbor Kingdom
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.26,0:12:18.13,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,My magic can heal this ocean?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.78,0:12:22.67,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Do major events like this \Nreally happen to villainesses?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.79,0:12:28.85,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,It'll be fine. Can you trust me?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.32,0:12:30.71,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Prince Aqua...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.75,0:12:35.35,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Prince Aqua indulged my selfish request.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.76,0:12:38.86,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Now it's my turn to believe in him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.25,0:12:43.49,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.35,0:12:48.91,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,I bestow the blessing of the Sky Fairy \NKing upon Aquasteed Marinforest.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.91,0:12:50.79,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,I'm putting my hopes in you,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.64,0:12:54.37,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,and your strength \Nas this nation's future king.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.34,0:12:58.47,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Um... Keith?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.93,0:13:03.93,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,I bestow the blessing of the Forest Fairy \NKing upon Tiararose Lapis Marinforest.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.49,0:13:07.89,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,I'm right here. You need only \Nkeep your eyes facing forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.15,0:13:43.88,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,It's all right, Tiara.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.88,0:13:45.70,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I'm right beside you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.70,0:13:49.44,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,This is my power we're talking about. \NThere's no way you can fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.44,0:13:52.02,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Prince Aqua... Keith...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.25,0:13:54.68,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I feel better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.02,0:14:00.59,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I mean, I can't even \Nimagine these two losing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.35,0:14:03.71,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,Let's do this, Tiara.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.14,0:14:08.30,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,I'll lend you my power. \NCall forth the trees and purify the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.30,0:14:09.45,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.23,0:14:17.46,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Trees of the forest, lend me \Nthe power to protect this kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.91,0:14:26.34,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Amazing... This is the power \Nof the Forest Fairy King?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.91,0:14:34.90,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,Blast it! Tiara's magic \Nisn't strong enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.90,0:14:38.21,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I knew it. Because I'm not the heroine...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.40,0:14:40.65,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.80,0:14:45.23,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Do you think we could use these cookies?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.23,0:14:47.98,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,They have my magic in them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.37,0:14:49.68,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.22,0:14:54.33,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,Yes, it'll work.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.06,0:15:05.30,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I can feel magic \Ncoursing through my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.68,0:15:08.06,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Trees of the forest, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.62,0:15:25.28,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,These trees will absorb \Nthe contaminated water.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.12,0:15:29.53,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,That just leaves...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.53,0:15:33.63,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,I'm here with you, \Nso you have to protect the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.11,0:15:38.14,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Come on, Aquasteed! \NPut more of your magic into it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.14,0:15:39.56,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.26,0:15:43.55,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Wind, bring light to this black ocean!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.63,0:16:31.07,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,It's beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.07,0:16:32.61,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,You did great.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.61,0:16:34.60,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Prince Aqua, could it be...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.60,0:16:37.58,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Yes, it seems the drug's \Neffects have worn off.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.94,0:16:43.25,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Your magic entered my body \Nthrough the cookie I ate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.25,0:16:44.72,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,That must be why.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.59,0:16:47.15,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I'm so glad!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.17,0:16:54.41,Default,Aqua,0,0,0,,Tiara, I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.41,0:16:56.59,Default,Aqua,0,0,0,,Thank you for believing in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.59,0:16:59.36,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I should be thanking you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.54,0:17:04.06,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I'm so glad we were able to \Nheal the ocean together.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.31,0:17:14.58,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Tiara?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.58,0:17:16.68,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Oh, it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.60,0:17:20.85,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Prince Aqua is dripping \Nwith handsomeness!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.36,0:17:24.23,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,But this Prince Aqua is mine alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.71,0:17:26.86,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Your hand is so warm, Tiara.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.86,0:17:29.81,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for touching you \Nwith my wet hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.81,0:17:32.13,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I'd like you to do it more, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.48,0:17:40.12,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I should feel cold from the water, \Nbut somehow, I feel hot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.85,0:17:43.08,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,My heart is pounding.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.08,0:17:46.62,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,Hey! Did you two forget we're here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.62,0:17:50.40,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Now, now. They worked so hard. \NWhat's the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.40,0:17:53.68,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,You're both soaked. I'll dry you off.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.42,0:17:59.60,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,It feels so warm and cozy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.99,0:18:01.11,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.11,0:18:02.53,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.35,0:18:05.81,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,Tiara, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.40,0:18:14.92,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Oh, what adorable flowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.92,0:18:18.06,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,It's a new species \Nthat bloomed from your magic.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.06,0:18:19.41,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,My magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.07,0:18:21.29,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.68,0:18:23.98,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,There seems to be something in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.98,0:18:25.21,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.77,0:18:29.17,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,It's your flower, \Nso why don't you open it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.17,0:18:30.09,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.96,0:18:32.65,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,What a sweet scent.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.30,0:18:38.97,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Could this be...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.76,0:18:40.89,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Tiara!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.39,0:18:43.73,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Oh, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.04,0:18:47.62,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,See? It's very sweet, delicious sugar!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.37,0:18:53.65,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,I don't know if I should say that's \Njust what I'd expect from you or...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.28,0:18:59.53,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,P-Prince Aqua?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.70,0:19:03.29,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Yes, your finger is sweet, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.31,0:19:09.00,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,Enough! Stop doing things \Nthat make me jealous!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.00,0:19:11.47,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Tiara is my wife!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.21,0:19:15.46,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Oh, really, you two. \NCan't you just get along?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.00,0:19:21.33,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,You're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.33,0:19:22.56,Default,Claire,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.33,0:19:30.48,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,Claire's probably angrier \Nabout all this than anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.94,0:19:35.64,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,Unlike me, he actually likes humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.64,0:19:38.34,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,I'm sure he'll handle it \Njust fine, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.65,0:19:42.74,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,He's scary when he's mad, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.74,0:19:46.11,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Keith! This is no laughing matter!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.11,0:19:48.06,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,Aw, sure it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.06,0:19:51.25,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,We can count on Claire to handle Pearl.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.06,0:19:56.18,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,We returned the ocean to normal,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.18,0:19:58.68,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,but Pearl's heart is still...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.30,0:20:03.16,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I'm going, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.67,0:20:08.34,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,There may be nothing I can do,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.34,0:20:12.44,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,but I want to talk \Nto King Pearl one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.06,0:20:14.18,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Tiara...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.86,0:20:17.55,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,But Pearl's castle is under the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.55,0:20:19.57,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,How are you going to see her?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.90,0:20:21.41,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.48,0:20:26.96,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,If you don't mind, \Ncould I come along as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.96,0:20:29.04,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Lady Icilla?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.04,0:20:33.13,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,I'm an absolute fool \Nand a horrible person.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.13,0:20:35.36,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,I should have known I couldn't change
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.36,0:20:38.10,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,Your Highness's feelings \Nwith such a potion.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.40,0:20:44.62,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,I won't ask you to forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.31,0:20:47.93,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,But if you would grant me one chance,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.93,0:20:51.98,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,I will protect Lady Tiararose \Nwith my very life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.39,0:20:55.17,Default,Icilla,0,0,0,,So, please... please...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.04,0:20:57.81,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Thank you for offering.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.09,0:21:08.20,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,I'll feel much better if you're with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.52,0:21:13.10,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Tiara, are you sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.10,0:21:16.13,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Yes. You can head back to the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.58,0:21:21.51,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,Put the people at ease with the news \Nthat we've healed the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.51,0:21:24.97,Default,Keith,0,0,0,,Tiara's starting to sound like \Na crown princess, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.97,0:21:27.14,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Yes, she really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.79,0:21:29.58,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,We'll be going, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.45,0:21:38.66,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,I'm sure this wouldn't \Nhave happened at all
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.66,0:21:40.66,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,if I'd never come to this country.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.70,0:21:44.91,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,That's why I have to \Nsee this through to the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.63,0:21:51.45,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,Including the future of those two...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.72,0:21:55.88,Italics,Tiararose INT,0,0,0,,and the end of this game!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.55,0:22:10.08,Default,Credits,0,0,0,,{\an9\fad(566,586)\shad0\fnVerdana\fs10\bord1.5\c&HFFF8EB&\3c&H712701&\b1\blur0.65\pos(475,262.783)}Translation:\NTiming:\NEditing and Typesetting:\NQuality Control:\NTranslation Check:
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.55,0:22:10.08,Default,Credits,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(566,586)\shad0\fnVerdana\fs10\bord1.5\c&HFFF8EB&\3c&H712701&\b1\blur0.65\pos(489,262.783)}Rebecca Cottrill\NMariana Martinez\NAshley Barboza\NS Bilyeu\NRei Miyasaka
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.05,0:23:40.02,Default,Title,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnTimesNewRoman\shad0\b1\3c&HFCFCFC&\fs25\c&HFC8A3D&\pos(325,123)\blur4\bord1\c&HB36BF7&\b1}Love{\b0} {\c&H343E6B&}Is {\b1\c&HFC8A3D&}Always{\b0} {\c&H343E6B&}and {\b1\c&HFC8A3D&}Forever{\b0}
Dialogue: 1,0:23:30.05,0:23:40.02,Default,Title,0,0,0,,{\an8\fnTimesNewRoman\shad0\b1\3c&HFCFCFC&\fs25\c&HFC8A3D&\pos(325,123)\bord1.75\c&HB36BF7&\b1}Love{\b0} {\c&H343E6B&}Is {\b1\c&HFC8A3D&}Always{\b0} {\c&H343E6B&}and {\b1\c&HFC8A3D&}Forever{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.14,0:23:34.93,Default,Aquasteed,0,0,0,,Tiara, I will always be by your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.36,0:23:39.21,Default,Tiararose,0,0,0,,No matter what the future holds, \Nas long as I'm with you...
